<dc:title><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Peer - E - Kamil (Roman English/ Hinglish) Completed</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:title><dc:creator><rdf:Seq><rdf:li>Miss__Khan</rdf:li></rdf:Seq></dc:creator><dc:description><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Yeh Novel femous author umera Ahmed ki Peer - E - Kamil jise main Miss.Khan Roman English (Hinglish) mein edit karke yahan per post kar rahi hun , kyunki yahan par Maine Peer - E - Kamal Ke bahut Sare story to dekhu Hain Lekin vah Sabhi English mein hai aur jo log English acche se nahin padh paate unke liye Hi Maine Roman English (Hinglish) mein yaha dena ka socha hai... vaise to main Bhi Ek writer hun aur mere kafi Sare Novel pocket novel aur pratilipi per chalti Hai , aur apni readers ke demand per Maine yah story Peer - E - Kamil yahan per Roman English (Hinglish) mein Dene Ka socha Hai....</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:description></rdf:Description>
